<title>INDIA: Indian ad hoc t-bills 15.70 bln rupees on Feb 21.</title>
<headline>Indian ad hoc t-bills 15.70 bln rupees on Feb 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India said on Monday the net issue of ad hoc treasury bills on February 21 was 15.70 billion rupees over the March 31, 1996 level, down from 30.80 billion rupees the previous week.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
